        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "That's not an error, that is a warning with `vim.notify()`. It is reasonable to be displayed to let the user know that 'mini.snippets' works and there is just no matches in context. Users can \"disable\" it inside their `vim.notify` implementation of choice.\n\nClosing as not planned.",
